  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Matthew Napoli identified North Korean and Iranian nuclear programs, the growth of China's nuclear arsenal, emerging technologies including artificial intelligence, nuclear security, and civil nuclear development as significant challenges for the next Deputy Administrator for Defense Nuclear Nonproliferation. He said he would ensure that the Defense Nuclear Nonproliferation office uses emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence to support its mission while assessing and responding to adversaries' malicious use of such technologies.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Matthew Napoli identified North Korean and Iranian nuclear programs, the growth of China's nuclear arsenal, emerging technologies including artificial intelligence, nuclear security, and civil nuclear development as significant challenges for the next Deputy Administrator for Defense Nuclear Nonproliferation.",
